# Secrets — never committed
.env

# Rendered emails and the local send record.
#
# Not secrets, but not ours to publish either: sent.jsonl records who every
# email went to, and a preview is a full report on a private house — indoor
# temperatures, when it is empty, when the cooling failed. This repository is
# public; that is a burglar's reading list.
data/

# Raw API captures: large, credential-bearing metadata, regenerable.
# samples/reports/ is deliberately NOT ignored — D2–D5 are the Phase 0
# deliverable and must be reviewable in history.
samples/raw/

# Python
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Tooling caches
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Pre-refactor backups of notebooks that have since been split. Local working
# copies, superseded by what is tracked -- and their saved outputs carry the
# console MAC, which is kept in Secret Manager precisely so it is not published.
notebooks/_prerefactor/

# Executed notebooks: large, full of data outputs, and regenerable.
# The source notebook under notebooks/ is what is tracked.
notebooks/executed.ipynb
notebooks/*-executed.ipynb
.ipynb_checkpoints/
notebooks/audit-executed.ipynb
